<title>POLAND: IRENA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.75 MLN.</title>
<headline>IRENA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 0.75 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.75 vs   0.89</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.12 vs   1.36</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.79 vs   1.02</p>
<p> Sales		    5.03 vs   6.73</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.15 vs   5.76</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 8.61 vs   8.07</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.37 vs   4.09</p>
<p> Sales		   43.89 vs  48.87</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish glass maker is HSG Irena SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
